OL,3,ARiyadh airport struck again as Houthis
OL,4,Asay they carried out attack that killed
OL,5,A12
OL,6,
OL,7,FA strike has caused a fire at Riyadh
OL,8,Fairport, a day after 12 people were
OL,9,Fkilled in a previous attack
OL,11,F"An unknown projectile" hit a passenger
OL,12,Fhall at King Khalid International
OL,13,FAirport, the Saudi-led coalition says -
OL,14,Fair defences separately intercepted a
OL,15,Fcruise missile near the airport
OL,17,FIt comes after Yemen's Houthis warned
OL,18,Faviation firms and passengers against
OL,19,Fusing Saudi airports and airspace
